\"uca0db182\">编程思路：找大数</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"u5b74d52d\" id=\"u5b74d52d\"><span data-lake-id=\"u65217014\" id=\"u65217014\">先假设一个数为最大值，让这个数与其他值相</span><strong><span data-lake-id=\"uf710093b\" id=\"uf710093b\" class=\"lake-fontsize-16\" style=\"color: #DF2A3F\">比较</span></strong><span data-lake-id=\"u273c9f4c\" id=\"u273c9f4c\">，如果他小就</span><strong><span data-lake-id=\"u68ec7753\" id=\"u68ec7753\" class=\"lake-fontsize-16\" style=\"color: #DF2A3F\">交换</span></strong><span data-lake-id=\"u789f8a05\" id=\"u789f8a05\">；</span></p><card type=\"block\" name=\"hr\" value=\"data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22t8UeY%22%7D\"></card><h1 data-lake-id=\"YxF6f\" id=\"YxF6f\"><span data-lake-id=\"u452c5640\" id=\"u452c5640\">2&gt; 打印成绩级别</span></h1><p data-lake-id=\"u7d469bf6\" id=\"u7d469bf6\"><span data-lake-id=\"uf6b0925d\" id=\"uf6b0925d\" class=\"lake-fontsize-14\">90分</span><strong><span data-lake-id=\"u86629549\" id=\"u86629549\" class=\"lake-fontsize-14\" style=\"color: #DF2A3F\">及</span></strong><span data-lake-id=\"u770c841e\" id=\"u770c841e\" class=\"lake-fontsize-14\">以上为优秀，80分及以上为良好，</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"u337557ea\" id=\"u337557ea\"><span data-lake-id=\"u7a668579\" id=\"u7a668579\" class=\"lake-fontsize-14\">60分及以上为及格，60分以下为不及格，</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"u906bc14d\" id=\"u906bc14d\"><span data-lake-id=\"u9e078242\" id=\"u9e078242\" class=\"lake-fontsize-14\"> 输入分数，打印出级别；</span></p><card type=\"inline\" name=\"codeblock\" value=\"data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22c%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%23include%20%3Cstdio.h%3E%5Cn%5Cnint%20main()%20%5Cn%7B%5Cn%20%20%20%20int%20score%3B%5Cn%20%20%20%20printf(%5C%22%E8%AF%B7%E8%BE%93%E5%85%A5%E5%88%86%E6%95%B0%EF%BC%9A%5C%22)%3B%5Cn%20%20%20%20scanf(%5C%22%25d%5C%22%2C%20%26score)%3B%5Cn%5Cn%20%20%20%20if%20(score%20%3E%3D%2090%20%26%26%20score%20%3C%3D%20100)%20%7B%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20printf(%5C%22%E4%BC%98%E7%A7%80%5C%5Cn%5C%22)%3B%5Cn%20%20%20%20%7D%20else%20if%20(score%20%3E%3D%2080%20%26%26%20score%20%3C%2090